        "answer": {
          "short": "Film B; the median age is 16. The ages are positively skewed, with younger viewers clustered between 12 and 16.",
          "worked": "Film B has a median viewer age of 16, close to 15. Its long right whisker indicates positive skewness. The lower half of viewer ages is clustered between 12 and 16, suggesting that it is popular with younger viewers.",
